    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See an Epic Finale Come to a Close...</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.poster.avif?t=1748549670\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.webm?t=1748549670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.mp4?t=1748549670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>DNA Episode 5 is the Season 1 Finale of DNA as Leo is summoned by Nova Corp to train Nova Troops in Hease City. As he arrives Leo's life completely changes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/27efadb39eab4d13561b473d99b43823.avif?t=1748549670\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oceana Island Awaits...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter a beautiful island region readied with its protectors. <br><br></li><li>Seek out your past in an epic finale to mark your future...<br><br></li><li> Battle the dangerous protectors of the Oceana, the mighty Oceanans...</li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/8540a377066c451e921562a82e27d778.avif?t=1748549670\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make your Mark in the Epic Finale...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Finish off the finale with DNA's epic 2D Beat'em up gameplay with new abilities to acquire!<br><br></li><li>Continue playing a challenging gameplay formula building upon previous Episodes' rewarding difficulties.<br><br></li><li> Fight stout new enemies as your traverse through the Oceana! </li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/1247ef6f62435a165e1f39fcb3015028.avif?t=1748549670\" width=620 height=310 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witness the Season Finale to a Remarkable Storyline...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Watch as the story develops further into intriguing events in Episode 5 of DNA.<br><br></li><li>Reunite with your old friend and mentor, former nova-corp troop now made protector of his home islands; Zublimus.<br><br></li><li> Flow through the episode with even more action-packed gameplay, and intriguing cinematics. </li></ul></i>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See an Epic Finale Come to a Close...</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.poster.avif?t=1748549670\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.webm?t=1748549670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/0d3de820b1dd38b98520dcce0c33ac5a.mp4?t=1748549670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>DNA Episode 5 is the Season 1 Finale of DNA as Leo is summoned by Nova Corp to train Nova Troops in Hease City. As he arrives Leo's life completely changes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/27efadb39eab4d13561b473d99b43823.avif?t=1748549670\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oceana Island Awaits...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enter a beautiful island region readied with its protectors. <br><br></li><li>Seek out your past in an epic finale to mark your future...<br><br></li><li> Battle the dangerous protectors of the Oceana, the mighty Oceanans...</li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/8540a377066c451e921562a82e27d778.avif?t=1748549670\" width=616 height=308 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make your Mark in the Epic Finale...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Finish off the finale with DNA's epic 2D Beat'em up gameplay with new abilities to acquire!<br><br></li><li>Continue playing a challenging gameplay formula building upon previous Episodes' rewarding difficulties.<br><br></li><li> Fight stout new enemies as your traverse through the Oceana! </li></ul></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944640/extras/1247ef6f62435a165e1f39fcb3015028.avif?t=1748549670\" width=620 height=310 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witness the Season Finale to a Remarkable Storyline...</strong></h2><br><i><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Watch as the story develops further into intriguing events in Episode 5 of DNA.<br><br></li><li>Reunite with your old friend and mentor, former nova-corp troop now made protector of his home islands; Zublimus.<br><br></li><li> Flow through the episode with even more action-packed gameplay, and intriguing cinematics. </li></ul></i>",
